# ==============================================================================
# Rota Mobile App — Public Environment Variables
# ==============================================================================
# Only variables prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ are bundled into the app.
# See docs/SECURITY.md §EXPO_PUBLIC_ audit for security notes on each.
# NEVER put secrets, database URLs, or payment keys in this file.
# ==============================================================================

# Base URL of the deployed Rota API.
# Safe to expose: this is a public endpoint. No credentials embedded.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Sentry DSN for the mobile app.
# Safe to expose: Sentry DSNs are designed to be public (client-side error
# collection). The DSN does not grant access to your Sentry project data.
# Never put a Sentry AUTH TOKEN (different from DSN) in this file.
# See: https://docs.sentry.io/concepts/key-terms/dsn-explainer/
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN=
